Claire D'Emic,claire,"B.S. Biology and French, Adelphi University; M.S. Ecology and Evolution, Fordham Un","Claire M. D'Emic is the STEM Initiatives Program Director at the Long Island Children's Museum and a doctoral student in Learning Sciences. Her research interests include cocreating informal science programs with local communities, the role of imagination and curiosity in learning, and the importance of play. ",
